# Data Sources, Dataset Documentation & Attribution

## 1. Project Overview

This project analyses FY2026 Hospital Value-Based Purchasing (VBP) Program data published by the Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services (CMS), United States.

The project integrates five hospital-level datasets to evaluate overall hospital performance, clinical outcomes, patient experience, patient safety, and efficiency.

The consolidated analytical dataset covers **2,455 hospital records**.

This documentation establishes the original data sources, reporting period, dataset coverage, integration approach and attribution for the project.

